{"id":"f80a790e5ccd9d21","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-ce-incompleteness.md","title":"CE Set Incompleteness","display":"thm-ce-incompleteness — CE Set Incompleteness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-ce-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-ce-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-ce-incompleteness — CE Set Incompleteness","depends_on":["[[92-df-ce-set]]","[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]"],"source":"第 VII 章 pp. 86–89；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 103–106、114）","source_status":"本地强数码定义的推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-ce-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-ce-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-incompleteness — CE Set Incompleteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VII 章 pp. 86–89；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 103–106、114）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地强数码定义的推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> (computably enumerable predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> (effective proof-system condition, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (strong numeralwise representability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>是递归可枚举的</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>不是可判定的</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>可强表示，则对输入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>并行搜索<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>对正实例和负实例的证明；表示性保证至少找到一个，相容性保证不会同时找到两个</li>\n<li>初等性使证明搜索有效，于是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>将可判定，与假设矛盾</li>\n<li>这是不完备性的集合论视角</li>\n<li>对满足相应有效性、相容性与算术强度的具体<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，其定理码集给出c.e.但不可判定的典型例子；这不是任意所谓“Gödel集”的无条件性质</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本条排除 c.e. 非递归集合的旧强 Rep_G：并行搜索正负实例证明会判定成员。Shepherdson S1 却保证普通 represent，非成员只须正实例不可证，因此两结论并不冲突。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VII 章 pp. 86–89；第 VIII 章 p. 97（PDF 103–106、114）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}(A)$ (computably enumerable predicate for $A$, see [[92-df-ce-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (external consistency predicate, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Elem}(G)$ (effective proof-system condition, see [[92-df-elementary-system]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2052,"backlinks":[{"id":"7745a6d434bbe885","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"无需 $\\omega$ 一致性，也不要求非成员实例的否定可证。c.e. 非递归集合普通可表示，与[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness]]排除旧强 $Rep_G$ 的结论完全相容。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["69a2a133da01f9c9","d9d845f6cd765d21","c7befd96bd551ade","e0eabee5d77258a7","b090f61b9f3ec664","360e00ddf38f0f16"]}